    "why_strict": "The loose rule matched the pattern anywhere in a sentence and read 'the decline of local news is a global phenomenon' as that piece DEFINING local news as a phenomenon eroding democracies. It is not what the author wrote, and printing it beside another author's definition would have misrepresented them both. The strict rule requires the term to be the subject of its own sentence.",
